# OpenCode Playbook has no repository-owned environment variables at 0.0.1.
# Never place provider credentials, GitHub tokens, or other secrets in this file.
# Planned tests set isolated HOME, XDG_CONFIG_HOME, XDG_DATA_HOME,
# XDG_CACHE_HOME, XDG_STATE_HOME, and OPENCODE_CONFIG_DIR values per process;
# they do not load them from a committed environment file.
# Live release verification additionally requires a non-secret model selector
# and the name, never the value, of an inherited provider credential variable:
# OPENCODE_PLAYBOOK_TEST_MODEL=provider/model
# OPENCODE_PLAYBOOK_TEST_CREDENTIAL_VAR=PROVIDER_API_KEY
